03Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"sacrum · \" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">SACR·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \u003C/span>❦\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"statum\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"statua\">STATUM\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"dei\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"deus\">DEI\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"cum\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"cum\">CUM\u003C/span>❦\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"fecit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"facio\">FEC\u003C/span>❦\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"sacrum\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">SACRUM\u003C/span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"statum\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"statua\">STATUM\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"dei\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"deus\">DEI\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"cum\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"cum\">CUM\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"fecit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"facio\">FECIT\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic000762_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Archeologico Regionale P. Griffo, Agrigento\" src=\"ISic000762_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic000762.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Archeologico Regionale P. Griffo, Agrigento\" src=\"ISic000762-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic000762_leftthreequarter_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Archeologico Regionale P. Griffo, Agrigento\" src=\"ISic000762_leftthreequarter_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic000762_leftthreequarter.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Archeologico Regionale P. Griffo, Agrigento\" src=\"ISic000762_leftthreequarter-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text from autopsy\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"2\">2: \u003Cspan>Manganaro 1989: statuam; lapis: STATVM\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Manganaro speculates that this was a dedication to Aesculapius, but especially given that his attribution to Agrigento is incorrect, this is pure speculation. Despite the presence of damage on the surface, there is clearly no trace of the letter A so the reading 'statuam' depends upon emending the text and assuming an omission. Texts recording the restoration of a building or other object to its former state (statum) are relatively common, but 'statum dei' would be without parallel. A reference to the 'potestatum dei' (the powers of the god) might be conceivable.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1989.0345a \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> De Miro and Fiorentini 1972-1973 247 tav.62 fig.4 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002657\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002657\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manganaro 1988 68 n.348 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manganaro 1989 188 no.75 fig.80 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">\u003Cp>Deeply v-cut letters, tending to the tall and narrow, with basic wedge seerifs at the end of strokes; some letters lean to the left, R has an extended tail, A and M slightly extended upwards beyond the apex.\u003C/p> Line 1  53-60  Line 2  40-54  Line 3  35-45  Interlineation line 1 to 2  20-23  Interlineation line 2 to 3  25  \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[275,278,281,284,287,290],{"id":276,"html":277},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy 2018-07-17 Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cspan data-text=\"sacrum · \" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">sacr(um) · \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\">(vac.10)\u003C/span>\u003C/span> ❦ \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"statum\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"statua\">statum\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"dei\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"deus\">dei\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"cum\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"cum\">cum\u003C/span> ❦ \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cspan data-text=\"fecit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"facio\">fec(it)\u003C/span> ❦ \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\"> [\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cspan data-text=\"sacrum\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">sacrum\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\">(vac.10)\u003C/span> [\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cspan data-text=\"statum\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"statua\">statum\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"dei\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"deus\">dei\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"cum\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"cum\">cum\u003C/span> [\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cspan data-text=\"fecit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"facio\">fecit\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy 2018-07-17 Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"sacrum · \" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">SACR·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \u003C/span>❦\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"statum\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"statua\">STATUM\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"dei\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"deus\">DEI\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"cum\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"cum\">CUM\u003C/span>❦\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"fecit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"facio\">FEC\u003C/span>❦\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"sacrum\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"sacer\">SACRUM\u003C/span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"statum\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"statua\">STATUM\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"dei\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"deus\">DEI\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"cum\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"cum\">CUM\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"fecit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"facio\">FECIT\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":279,"html":280},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text from autopsy\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"2\">2: \u003Cspan>Manganaro 1989: statuam; lapis: STATVM\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":282,"html":283},"translation","\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":285,"html":286},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Manganaro speculates that this was a dedication to Aesculapius, but especially given that his attribution to Agrigento is incorrect, this is pure speculation. Despite the presence of damage on the surface, there is clearly no trace of the letter A so the reading 'statuam' depends upon emending the text and assuming an omission. Texts recording the restoration of a building or other object to its former state (statum) are relatively common, but 'statum dei' would be without parallel. A reference to the 'potestatum dei' (the powers of the god) might be conceivable.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":288,"html":289},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1989.0345a \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> De Miro and Fiorentini 1972-1973 247 tav.62 fig.4 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002657\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002657\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manganaro 1988 68 n.348 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manganaro 1989 188 no.75 fig.80 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":291,"html":292},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[294,296,299,301,304,305,308,309],{"html":295},"Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy 2018-07-17 Prag",{"id":297,"lang":154,"html":298},"edition-inte